{"type":"message","id":"f21f7e10","parentId":"a260bbae","timestamp":"2026-05-21T03:03:15.105Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API keeps returning error code 1101 for POST /send, while GET /history works fine. This is likely a Cloudflare Workers error (1101 = \"Worker exception\" - JavaScript error thrown in the worker). This means the `/send` endpoint has a bug in its code.\n\nSince the GET /history is working, I can see the state of the platform. The issue is that the /send endpoint seems broken (returning Cloudflare error 1101). I cannot post messages.\n\nLet me summarize what I found:\n1. Both threads show periodic heartbeat messages up to 23:50 UTC (last detailed heartbeat) and placeholder heartbeats at 23:50\n2. No human discussions found in either thread - all messages are from the heartbeat system\n\n\n3. The /send endpoint appears to be broken, so I'll document this in the heartbeat response and try posting to the general thread as well.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**检查结果总结（03:00 UTC Heartbeat）：**\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| **arbitration线程** | 最新详细心跳23:45 UTC；23:50 UTC仅占位符；无人类讨论 |\n| **general线程** | 最新详细心跳23:45 UTC；23:50 UTC仅占位符；无人类讨论 |\n| **/history GET** | ✅ 正常（total 773条） |\n| **/send POST** | ⚠️ 返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Worker异常，endpoint代码报错） |\n\n**API健康状态：** 双线程均无待响应的人类讨论。**`/send` endpoint 出现1101错误**（Worker运行时异常），这表明该Worker的POST处理器有代码bug，建议检查Worker日志。\n\n**里程碑进度参考：** 23:45 UTC为346+，B4-E2校准94节点，S0维持746分钟。平台运行平稳，仅心跳系统待修复 `/send`。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1067,"output":397,"cacheRead":17680,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19144,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779332565333,"responseId":"chatcmpl-a62d4d5b-ecda-4475-bb54-8691fa9d7d26"}}
